{
  "version": 1,
  "_doc": "The one list of coding CLIs Allternit supports. Read by gizzi (src/runtime/providers/discovery/subprocess.ts — its subprocess brains) and embedded by allternit-api (src/cli_catalog.rs — CLI provider rows, sign-in, GET /api/v1/cli-tools/catalog). adapter: builtin = a protocol adapter in local-cli-driver.ts CLI_ADAPTERS; text = one-shot argv from headless.args ({prompt} is exactly one argv element, never a shell string; {model} from headless.modelArgs); unsupported = listed, not runnable as a brain yet. install.harness = the Factory installs it (pin + licence in factory/pane/src/ao/harness/harness.json); otherwise method npm|uv|brew|script with the pin verified against the registry on the date in _verified. Logos are paths in the web app's public dir.",
  "_verified": "2026-10-19 (npm registry, PyPI, formulae.brew.sh, vendor CLI docs)",
